{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Luxa RAW Camera 是一款主打減少手機過度處理的 iPhone 拍攝 App，適合希望保留自然紋理、又不想被複雜流程綁住的攝影愛好者。它支援在相容裝置上拍攝 RAW 與 ProRAW，亦可使用手動 ISO 與快門控制。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-51.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>減少處理保留真實質感</h2>\n<p>Luxa RAW Camera 以較剋制的處理方式，盡量保留皮膚、頭髮、布料、植物與建築等日常場景的自然紋理；在相容裝置上可拍攝 RAW 或 ProRAW，亦支援手動調整 ISO 與快門速度。想快速分享時，可使用 Apple 影像處理流程輸出 HEIF，並為照片加入簡潔浮水印與拍攝資訊。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-448-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-449-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-450-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-451-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-452-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-453-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Luxa RAW Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/luxa-raw-camera/id6809432210?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:42:11.168755+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:05:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:58:08.608929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:21.029651+00:00","content_hash":"0c46461528d18c046c12e94ebc3f8c1931a6195f128ed7290cc9fefb8cc37fd8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:42:11.168755+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}